l as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Position of Not"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to emphasize that something or an action is opposite to what is expected, use <span class=\"italic\">not</span>, rather than a contraction in the sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Otherwise things will <span class=\"strong\">not</span> change, will they?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"strong\">not</span> shows a firmness on the part of the speaker while still being polite."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When speaking, the <span class=\"strong\">not</span> is pronounced louder and longer that it is normally. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He does not listen to me and that isn't right, is it?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "My boyfriend did not want to take out the trash, and he should right?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I was not able to do it all alone, was I? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He could not expect me to either, could he? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Otherwise things will not change, will they?"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le07ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to come up with"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to contribute with an idea or an action."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  We came up with a compromise."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le07ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about domestic activities."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "alone "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a state of being without anyone or anything."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was not able to do it all alone, was I?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le07ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to evaluate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to determine the importance of or value of "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Evaluate your situation and make decisions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le07ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to help out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to assist or aid"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Whenever I ask him to help out around the house, he just does not do it. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le07ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trash "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something considered worthless or rubbish"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I explained that I couldn't work, cook, clean, do laundry, take out the garbage and shop for food. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le07ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "separate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not joined, together "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I told him that if the relationship wasn't working out we could go our separate ways."}, {"type": "au