nt to do any of the chores and that's not fair is it? He felt that me, the woman, should do everything. We had a long serious talk. I told him that if the relationship wasn't working out we could go our separate ways. If he valued it, we would have to work things out.", "id": 2}, {"time": "56800", "image": "engenn9le07ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "I explained that I couldn't work, cook, clean, do laundry, take out the garbage and shop for food. I was not able to do it all alone, was I? He could not expect me to either, could he? We came up with a compromise. This is what you have to do next. Evaluate your situation and make decisions. Otherwise things will not change, will they?<br/>\nSally", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}